[PrintTextModified Text:看守把我押送到了<br>位于地下层的惩罚室。|#0201Adv24_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter

; 水滴の音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_121 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1.25
@StopSfx
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_121 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:火把的火焰不断摇曳。<br>不知从何处传来秒针滴答般的滴水声。|#0201Adv24_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（3600次。大约就是一个小时吧）|#0201Adv24_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0201Adv24_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不论时间过了多久，我的愤怒还是无法平息。|#0201Adv24_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 鉄製の扉を開く音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_62 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，古老的金属发出了吱呀声。<br>沉重的门被小心翼翼地打开了。|#0201Adv24_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:门口出现两个人影。|#0201Adv24_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……看来我们可以进去了。|#0201Adv24_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想你的衣服可能被颜料弄脏了，<br>所以带来了换洗衣物和毛巾。<br>出去时用吧。|#0201Adv24_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，那个，你没事吗……？|#0201Adv24_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……谢谢。<br>我应该向你们好好表达谢意才对。|#0201Adv24_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，我看起来像没事的样子吗？<br>照这样下去，我只能等着被处刑了。|#0201Adv24_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛也带来了毛巾，<br>站在我身边帮我擦拭污渍。|#0201Adv24_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样下去太惨了……|#0201Adv24_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……来者偏偏是樱羽艾玛。|#0201Adv24_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，如果说有谁会来探望，我想应该就是她了。<br>这一点让我心情更加复杂。|#0201Adv24_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛咬着嘴唇，<br>痛苦地低着头，继续帮我擦拭污渍。|#0201Adv24_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆呟き

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，为什么……|#0201Adv24_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:什么为什么？<br>你是想问我为什么杀了梅露露吗？|#0201Adv24_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:不……|#0201Adv24_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但听起来你就是在怀疑我啊？|#0201Adv24_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……怎么会……|#0201Adv24_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Duration:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗……让你经历这样的事，<br>我真的很抱歉。我本想保护你的……|#0201Adv24_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……不需要保护。<br>在你们眼中，我可能就是凶手。|#0201Adv24_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我冷冷地瞪视着两人。|#0201Adv24_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——当然，在我看来，<br>你们也可能是凶手。|#0201Adv24_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:这、这怎么可能！<br>我——|#0201Adv24_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只是说有这种可能。<br>我只需在审判中证明自己的清白。|#0201Adv24_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这个所谓的先行投票真是残酷。<br>它在少女们心中种下了分裂的种子。|#0201Adv24_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，多亏如此，我的决心更加坚定了。<br>我会独自生存下去，不依靠任何人。|#0201Adv24_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我的眼神，想必正闪烁着阴冷的光芒吧。|#0201Adv24_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当然，选择合作也是一种方法。|#0201Adv24_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:若解释事件前后的情况，<br>或许能获得推理的线索。|#0201Adv24_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但在不知谁是真凶的情况下，<br>这反而可能给凶手提供消息。|#0201Adv24_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（凶手无疑正试图陷害我）|#0201Adv24_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（那么，这两个主动接近我的人，<br>　很可能就是凶手）|#0201Adv24_Hiro013|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（善意是敌人。牵绊是毒药。<br>　我再也不会被这些东西绊倒了）|#0201Adv24_Hiro014|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希、希罗。别把自己孤立起来！<br>如果大家一起合作的话，一定能——|#0201Adv24_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:合作？<br>这就是合作的结果。|#0201Adv24_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我感到头晕目眩。<br>我无法接受艾玛口中那些漂亮话。|#0201Adv24_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，我最不相信的就是你。|#0201Adv24_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗……为什么？<br>求你了，请听我解释——|#0201Adv24_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:闭嘴！！<br>我不想看到你的脸，也不想听到你的声音！！|#0201Adv24_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果你还有一丝在乎我的心，<br>就给我滚出去！！|#0201Adv24_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,3.5 Zoom:0.6 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.1 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.1

[PrintTextModified Text:——到此为止！|#0201Adv24_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅一声高喊，<br>盖过了我的怒吼。|#0201Adv24_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:什么……|#0201Adv24_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一种不可思议的现象，让我不由得屏住了呼吸。|#0201Adv24_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我被声音吸引，将视线落在了蕾雅身上，<br>发现自己无法将目光从她脸上移开。|#0201Adv24_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:……吓到你了吧。这就是我的魔法。<br>我可以【引导视线】。|#0201Adv24_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:人们常说，<br>不知为何无法将目光从舞台上的我身上移开呢。|#0201Adv24_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:我想让你稍微信任我一点。<br>所以我想，不妨把我的魔法揭露给你看。<br>|#0201Adv24_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅温柔地笑了。|#0201Adv24_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……能解除吗？|#0201Adv24_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.4 Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我刚提出要求，视线就恢复了自由。|#0201Adv24_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@UpdateWitchBook Id:Leia Category:Profile Version:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:看来你们之间<br>曾经发生过什么事呢。<br>能和我说说吗？|#0201Adv24_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我拒绝。|#0201Adv24_Hiro021| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……我明白了。<br>现在，还是让你静一静比较好。|#0201Adv24_Leia010| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅说完，就劝艾玛一起离开。|#0201Adv24_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛似乎被我的激烈的态度吓到，<br>在蕾雅的催促下拖着沉重的脚步离开了。|#0201Adv24_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗……待会见……|#0201Adv24_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; 鉄製の扉を開く音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_62 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:随后门被关上，再次恢复了寂静。|#0201Adv24_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……这是最糟糕的情况……）|#0201Adv24_Hiro022| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（但我真的能说，<br>　人不是我杀的吗……？）|#0201Adv24_Hiro023|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

