[PrintTextModified Text:紧接着，脑海中闪过<br>自己失控的样子——|#0201Adv24_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（说不定是我失去理智，把梅露露给……）|#0201Adv24_Hiro024| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（反正这样下去都要被处刑了，<br>　还不如死掉重来……）|#0201Adv24_Hiro025|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

