[PrintTextModified Text:下一个瞬间，我又清醒了过来。|#0201Adv24_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（自杀……？我吗……？）|#0201Adv24_Hiro026| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一种让我不寒而栗的<br>嫌恶感传遍全身。|#0201Adv24_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我在想什么啊。<br>　无论如何，绝对不可以【自杀】）|#0201Adv24_Hiro027|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我绝对不会用这种<br>　夺走了朋友生命的禁忌方式！）|#0201Adv24_Hiro028|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我没有杀害梅露露。<br>　我没有——！）|#0201Adv24_Hiro029|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

